# Line-ending policy.
#
# The raw acquisition files are evidence: they are checked against the
# SHA-256 digests recorded in
#   Note6_repeatability_stability_noise/data/raw_acquisition_D2DC2C/清单_SHA256.csv
# so a checkout must reproduce their bytes exactly.  Forcing LF everywhere
# stops Git from rewriting line endings on Windows, which would otherwise
# change every file size and break every digest.
#
# `text=auto` still lets Git diff text files normally; `eol=lf` pins the
# checked-out form.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary payloads: never touched.
*.mat   binary
*.npz   binary
*.png   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.zip   binary